    },
    {
      "kind": "utterance",
      "external_id": "u_b2_negotiating_arrangements_flexible",
      "data": {
        "lesson_key": "b2-negotiating-arrangements-02",
        "text": {
          "en": "I'm fairly flexible on location as long as we have a quiet place to talk."
        },
        "translations": {
          "fa": "از نظر مکان نسبتاً منعطفم، به شرطی که جای آرومی برای صحبت داشته باشیم."
        },
        "intent": "show_flexibility",
        "concept_refs": [
          "b2_negotiating_arrangements_flexible"
        ],
        "cefr": "B2",
        "topic": "polite-language",
        "register": "neutral",
        "status": "approved"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "utterance",
      "external_id": "u_b2_negotiating_arrangements_workaround",
      "data": {
        "lesson_key": "b2-negotiating-arrangements-02",
        "text": {
          "en": "If the room isn't available, we could work around that by joining remotely."
        },
        "translations": {
          "fa": "اگر اتاق در دسترس نباشه می‌تونیم با آنلاین شدن این محدودیت رو دور بزنیم."
        },
        "intent": "propose_workaround",
        "concept_refs": [
          "b2_negotiating_arrangements_available",
          "b2_negotiating_arrangements_work_around"
        ],
        "cefr": "B2",
        "topic": "polite-language",
        "register": "neutral",
        "status": "approved"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "utterance",
      "external_id": "u_b2_negotiating_arrangements_compromise",
      "data": {
        "lesson_key": "b2-negotiating-arrangements-03",
        "text": {
          "en": "A reasonable compromise would be to shorten the session and schedule a follow-up next week."
        },
        "translations": {
          "fa": "یک راه‌حل میانه منطقی اینه که جلسه رو کوتاه‌تر کنیم و هفته بعد ادامه بدیم."
        },
        "intent": "propose_compromise",
        "concept_refs": [
          "b2_negotiating_arrangements_compromise",
          "b2_negotiating_arrangements_arrangement"
        ],
        "cefr": "B2",
        "topic": "polite-language",
        "register": "neutral",
        "status": "approved"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "utterance",
      "external_id": "u_b2_negotiating_arrangements_soften",
      "data": {
        "lesson_key": "b2-negotiating-arrangements-03",
        "text": {
          "en": "I see why Friday suits you better, but could we avoid the late afternoon?"
        },
        "translations": {
          "fa": "می‌فهمم چرا جمعه برات بهتره، ولی می‌شه آخر عصر رو انتخاب نکنیم؟"
        },
        "intent": "soften_disagreement",
        "concept_refs": [
          "b2_negotiating_arrangements_flexible"
        ],
        "cefr": "B2",
        "topic": "polite-language",
        "register": "neutral",
        "status": "approved"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "utterance",
      "external_id": "u_b2_negotiating_arrangements_confirm",
      "data": {
        "lesson_key": "b2-negotiating-arrangements-03",
        "text": {
          "en": "Once we agree on the time, I'll send a short message to confirm the final arrangement."
        },
        "translations": {
          "fa": "وقتی روی زمان توافق کنیم یک پیام کوتاه برای تأیید هماهنگی نهایی می‌فرستم."
        },
        "intent": "confirm_plan",
        "concept_refs": [
          "b2_negotiating_arrangements_confirm",
          "b2_negotiating_arrangements_arrangement"
        ],
        "cefr": "B2",
        "topic": "polite-language",
        "register": "neutral",
        "status": "approved"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "utterance",
      "external_id": "u_b2_negotiating_arrangements_summary",
      "data": {
        "lesson_key": "b2-negotiating-arrangements-03",
        "text": {
          "en": "So we're keeping the same day, moving it earlier, and allowing remote attendance if needed."
        },
        "translations": {
          "fa": "پس همون روز رو نگه می‌داریم، زودتر برگزارش می‌کنیم و اگر لازم شد حضور آنلاین هم ممکنه."
        },
        "intent": "summarize_agreement",
        "concept_refs": [
          "b2_negotiating_arrangements_work_around"
        ],
        "cefr": "B2",
        "topic": "polite-language",
        "register": "neutral",
        "status": "approved"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "grammar_point",
      "external_id": "g_b2_negotiating_arrangements_softening",
      "data": {
        "lesson_key": "b2-negotiating-arrangements-01",
        "slug": "b2-negotiating-arrangements-softening",
        "title": "Softening requests and disagreement",
        "rule_summary": "Use could, would, perhaps, a little, and indirect wording to make requests or disagreement less abrupt.",
        "explanation": {
          "fa": "برای نرم‌تر کردن درخواست یا مخالفت از could، would، perhaps و عبارت‌های غیرمستقیم استفاده می‌کنیم."
        },
        "examples": [
          {
            "en": "Could we look at another option?",
            "fa": "می‌شه یک گزینه دیگر را بررسی کنیم؟"
          },
          {
            "en": "I'm not sure that would solve the main issue.",
            "fa": "مطمئن نیستم این مشکل اصلی را حل کند."
          }
        ],
        "cefr": "B2",
        "status": "approved"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "grammar_point",
      "external_id": "g_b2_negotiating_arrangements_conditionals",
      "data": {
        "lesson_key": "b2-negotiating-arrangements-02",
        "slug": "b2-negotiating-arrangements-conditionals",
        "title": "Conditionals for consequences",
        "rule_summary": "Use conditional clauses to connect a possible action with its likely or imagined consequence.",
        "explanation": {
          "fa": "با جمله‌های شرطی یک اقدام احتمالی را به نتیجه واقعی یا فرضی آن وصل می‌کنیم."
        },
        "examples": [
          {
            "en": "If we leave earlier, we'll avoid traffic.",
            "fa": "اگر زودتر راه بیفتیم از ترافیک دور می‌مانیم."
          },
          {
            "en": "If I had a larger budget, I'd choose the faster option.",
            "fa": "اگر بودجه بیشتری داشتم گزینه سریع‌تر را انتخاب می‌کردم."
          }
        ],
        "cefr": "B2",
        "status": "approved"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "grammar_point",
      "external_id": "g_b2_negotiating_arrangements_negotiation",
      "data": {
        "lesson_key": "b2-negotiating-arrangements-03",
        "slug": "b2-negotiating-arrangements-negotiation",
        "title": "Negotiation language",
        "rule_summary": "Clarify constraints, propose alternatives, and use conditional offers to move toward a workable agreement.",
        "explanation": {
          "fa": "در مذاکره محدودیت را روشن می‌کنیم، گزینه جایگزین می‌دهیم و با پیشنهاد شرطی به توافق عملی نزدیک می‌شویم."
        },
        "examples": [
          {
            "en": "If you can deliver by Friday, we can accept the higher price.",
            "fa": "اگر تا جمعه تحویل بدهید می‌توانیم قیمت بالاتر را قبول کنیم."
          },
          {
            "en": "What if we split the work into two stages?",
            "fa": "اگر کار را به دو مرحله تقسیم کنیم چطور؟"
          }
        ],
        "cefr": "B2",
        "status": "approved"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "external_id": "d_b2_negotiating_arrangements_scene_1",
      "data": {
        "lesson_key": "b2-negotiating-arrangements-01",
        "title": "Negotiating Arrangements: part 1",
        "setting": "coffee break",
        "cefr": "B2",
        "topic": "polite-language",
        "characters": [
          "Nora",
          "Samir"
        ],
        "turns": [
          {
            "order": 1,
            "speaker": "Nora",
            "text": "What do you think is the main issue here?",
            "translation_fa": "فکر می‌کنی مسئله اصلی اینجا چیه؟"
          },
          {
            "order": 2,
            "speaker": "Samir",
            "text": "I can move the meeting, but I have a hard constraint after three o'clock.",
            "translation_fa": "می‌تونم جلسه رو جابه‌جا کنم، ولی بعد از ساعت سه یک محدودیت قطعی دارم."
          },
          {
            "order": 3,
            "speaker": "Nora",
            "text": "What makes that the most important point?",
            "translation_fa": "چی باعث می‌شه این مهم‌ترین نکته باشه؟"
          },
          {
            "order": 4,
